1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,980
Harvey never saw the last link.

2
00:00:02,192 --> 00:00:05,058
He proved your blood goes round, but not how it

3
00:00:05,128 --> 00:00:07,378
crosses from arteries to veins.

4
00:00:07,649 --> 00:00:10,819
He died in sixteen fifty-seven, still guessing.

5
00:00:10,947 --> 00:00:14,899
Four years later, Marcello Malpighi put a frog's lung under

6
00:00:14,939 --> 00:00:15,859
a microscope.

7
00:00:15,966 --> 00:00:20,259
There it was: a net of vessels finer than hairs.

8
00:00:20,379 --> 00:00:21,459
Capillaries.

9
00:00:21,559 --> 00:00:24,259
The last link Harvey never saw.

